                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-12 about-des">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="about-des-col">
                            <div class="about-img">
                                <img class="img-fluid" src="img/about-1.jpg" />
                            </div>
                            <p>
                                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed ante felis, gravida at odio viverra, blandit suscipit leo. Fusce mattis justo at diam laoreet, sed pretium leo semper.
                            </p>
                            <a href="#">Read More</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="about-des-col">
                            <div class="about-img">
                                <img class="img-fluid" src="img/about-2.jpg" />
                            </div>
                            <p>
                                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed ante felis, gravida at odio viverra, blandit suscipit leo. Fusce mattis justo at diam laoreet, sed pretium leo semper.
                            </p>
